  "description": "<p data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"517\"><strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"273\">Fitness Boxing 2</strong> is de ideale game om thuis actief te blijven! Met ritmische boksworkouts, persoonlijke trainingsschema’s en energieke muziek sla je je fit terwijl je Joy-Con de bewegingen registreert. Perfect voor spelers die sport en gamen willen combineren.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"641\">Dit exemplaar verkeert <strong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"560\">In Nette Staat</strong>, volledig getest en 100% functioneel.<br data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"601\">Wordt <strong data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"640\">standaard met doosje geleverd</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"660\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<li data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"702\">\r\n<p data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"702\">🥊 Ritmische box-oefeningen op muziek</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"751\">\r\n<p data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"751\">💪 Personaliseerbare workouts en intensiteit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"793\">\r\n<p data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"793\">🎮 Eenvoudige en motiverende gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"824\">\r\n<p data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"824\">🧘 Train op je eigen tempo</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<p data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"885\">👥 Gesplitste registratie voor beide Joy-Con controllers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"890\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"914\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"1106\">\r\n<li data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"946\">\r\n<p data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"946\"><strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"927\">Titel:</strong> Fitness Boxing 2</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"980\">\r\n<p data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"980\"><strong data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"962\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1010\">\r\n<p data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1010\"><strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"993\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1049\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1049\"><strong data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1023\">Genre:</strong> Fitness / Ritme / Sport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1077\"><strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1064\">Spelers:</strong> 1–2 lokaal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1106\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1106\"><strong data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1093\">Geleverd:</strong> Met doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1111\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1146\"><strong data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1136\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 1 maand</h3>",
